d6f174efd1e"],"startLine":85}],"specificationIntents":[{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","purpose":"# Feature\n\nA page shows one egg emoji in the middle. Below it, the word 'Eggs' appears in sans-serif text.\n\n# Intention & objectives\n\nThe page lets a visitor see an egg emoji centered on the screen. The word 'Eggs' sits under it in a plain sans-serif typeface."},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-timer/egg-timer.spec.md","purpose":"# Feature\n\nA page where a person picks how to boil their egg — soft, medium, or hard — starts a countdown, and sees a clear message when the egg is ready.\n\nThe egg timer page adopts the `eggs-web` blueprint.\n\n# Intention & objectives\n\nLet a person know how long to boil their egg and when to take it out, on one small page. The person picks a doneness, presses Start, watches a countdown, and reads a message when the egg is ready."}],"targetRevision":"sha256:3c617fa256326e03a8289fbeb29826620ef849e80b59c741bd0a4fe486519b67"},"schema":"axiom.desired-state-instruction-package","schemaVersion":8,"verificationArtifactRevision":"sha256:d4d7e3e1711c98d16513e6de47059ca44399cdc94c4c5c91690a414eb681563f","verificationAssignments":[{"authorityArtifactRevision":"sha256:d4d7e3e1711c98d16513e6de47059ca44399cdc94c4c5c91690a414eb681563f","evidenceIdentities":["invariant-assumed-deterministic-check:v1:225a62f1-f110-1273-50b8-32d25851a9bf"],"mechanism":"deterministic_check","requirementIdentity":"225a62f1-f110-1273-50b8-32d25851a9bf"},{"authorityArtifactRevision":"sha256:d4d7e3e1711c98d16513e6de47059ca44399cdc94c4c5c91690a414eb681563f","evidenceIdentities":["invariant-assumed-deterministic-check:v1:2911106c-9a29-de68-7c99-e14bc871dcd2"],"mechanism":"deterministic_check","requirementIdentity":"2911106c-9a29-de68-7c99-e14bc871dcd2"},{"authorityArtifactRevision":"sha256:d4d7e3e1711c98d16513e6de47059ca44399cdc94c4c5c91690a414eb681563f","evidenceIdentities":["invariant-assumed-deterministic-check:v1